# Repo convention: CRLF line endings for tracked text files (matches the
# Windows/WSL editor this project is developed in -- see CLAUDE.md's dev
# environment). `text=auto` lets git auto-detect text vs. binary; anything
# it classifies as text is normalized to CRLF in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Explicit binary overrides -- belt-and-suspenders on top of text=auto's
# heuristic detection for the file types actually in this repo.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
